        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#licensing" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">1. How a Licensed Fitness Brand Works</a>
          <a href="#identify-yours" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. Identifying Who Built Your Machine</a>
          <a href="#getting-parts" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. Getting Parts Without a Manufacturer Name</a>
